63,https://www.oracle.com/artificial-intelligence/generative-ai/generative-ai-service/product-tour/,Generative AI and LLM Product Tour | Oracle,1037,6680,1,28,www.oracle.com,/artificial-intelligence/generative-ai/generative-ai-service/product-tour/,Generative AI,Product Tour,success,2025-07-11 21:15:39,"Accessibility Policy  Close Search Search Oracle.com QUICK LINKS Oracle Cloud Infrastructure Oracle Fusion Cloud Applications Oracle Database Download Java Careers at Oracle Search Country   Contact Sales Sign in to Oracle Cloud Cloud Artificial Intelligence Generative AI Generative AI Service Generative AI Service Product Tour Speak to an AI expert Overview Features Pricing FAQ Product Tour The overview view provides a  on the left with options: Overview Playground Dedicated AI clusters Custom models Endpoints Under Scope a dropdown  allows the user to select their compartment. Power your apps with large language models and generative AI OCI Generative AI is a fully managed service that provides a set of state-of-the-art, customizable LLMs that cover a wide range of use cases for text generation. Use the playground to try out the models out-of-the-box or create and host your own fine-tuned custom models based on your own data on dedicated AI clusters. The following Metrics are provided for the current component: Dedicated AI clusters Custom models Endpoints Sections for Resources and Get started are cropped on the edge of the image. A fully managed generative AI service built for business Leverage customizable large language models (LLMs) that are pretrained and ready to use. Use these models across a large set of generative AI use cases, such as text summarization, copy generation, search, chat, and more. Read more about Oracleâ€™s generative AI strategy Learn more about generative AI use cases The Generative AI Playground view allows the user to select the model and example. AI parameters available for the user to change in the right column include: Maximum output tokens Temperature Top p Top k Stop sequence Frequency penalty Additional parameters are cropped at the bottom of the image. Sample input and output text is shown. In this case a paragraph of instructions on updating a computer operating system is provides as input, with instructions to provide output as a numbered list, which is shown. Use the Playground for out-of-the-box models and sample library The Playground provides a chat-like exploratory experience to easily work with the out-of-the-box LLMs and fine-tuned custom models. Experiment with parameter settings to change the model output. Automatically generated Python and Java code snippets can be used in your applications. Enterprise-grade generative AI with data governance and security Only you have access to your data and custom trained models. Only you can use a custom model trained on your data. No other customers can see your data or custom models. Learn more about data handling in OCI Generative AI Best-in-class Al infrastructure Use prebuilt models on demand by paying only for tokens sent and received or use dedicated Al clusters available for predictable performance and pricing. Both use OCl, which provides industry-leading performance and cost efficiency with NVIDIA GPUs. Discover OCI AI infrastructure Start fast with pretrained, out-of-the-box LLMs Models from Cohere and Meta are available out of the box. Cohere Command R and R+ Cohere Embed Meta Llama 3 Learn more about the pretrained models Input, output and parameters are shown from the Generative AI Playground view. AI parameters available for the user to change in the right column include: Maximum output tokens Temperature Top p Top k Stop sequence Frequency penalty Presence penalty Additional parameters are cropped at the bottom of the image. Sample input and output text is shown. In this case the LLM is asked to create a text job description for a data visualization expert with a list of three qualifications, and the output text is shown below (and cropped). Text generation Rapidly create job descriptions, blogs, emails, marketing copy, and more. Perform text translations. Ask questions conversationally in natural language. Learn more about generation model usage and parameters Input, output and parameters are shown from the Summarization view. AI parameters available for the user to change in the right column include: Length Format Extractiveness Temperature Additional command Sample input and output text is shown. In this case two paragraphs about Oracle's AI strategy are provides as input, while the output contains four bullet points summarizing the paragraphs. Summarization Create short, accurate, and fluent summaries of articles, blogs, emails, and other bodies of text using the Cohere Summarize model. Save time and effort to comprehend and share the core ideas within a longer text document. Learn more about summarization models Cropped at the top is a list of 11 items showing statements 9. We are committed to being transparent with our customers about our... 10. Billing can be a complex process, and we are here to help our custom... 11. We value our customers and want to ensure that they are happy with... Below are buttons for Run and Clear, followed by an output vector projection chart with points labelled one through eleven. A button to Export embeddings to JSON is provided. Embedding Create vector representations of paragraphs, sentences, and phrases. Visualize the output vector to identify outliers and similarly grouped phrases. Use these vector representations for semantic search, text classification, and many other use cases. Create model interface is shown. Three steps are listed as links: Model definition Fine-tuning configuration (current step) Data selection Fine-tuning configuration options are available: Base model Fine-tuning method Compartment / Dedicated AI cluster Refine models with your own business knowledge Fine-tune Cohere and Llama 3 models with your domain knowledge and leverage the custom model endpoints in your applications. Use dedicated fine-tuning clusters for predictable performance and pricing. See the model endpoint documentation The overview view provides a  on the left with options: Overview Playground Dedicated AI clusters Custom models Endpoints Under Scope a dropdown  allows the user to select their compartment. Power your apps with large language models and generative AI OCI Generative AI is a fully managed service that provides a set of state-of-the-art, customizable LLMs that cover a wide range of use cases for text generation. Use the playground to try out the models out-of-the-box or create and host your own fine-tuned custom models based on your own data on dedicated AI clusters. The following Metrics are provided for the current component: Dedicated AI clusters Custom models Endpoints Sections for Resources and Get started are cropped on the edge of the image. Next steps Learn more about generative AI Speak to an AI expert"
